   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-070",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "测试（用户验证）",
   "label": "周五",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-071",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "通用产品设计程序（瀑布模型视角）：规划→概念设计→初步设计→详细设计→试制测试→量产推广",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-072",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "发现定义开发交付，发散收敛两次钻石；IDEO五步：共情定义构思原型测试，以人为本循环迭代；代尔夫特理性循环：分析综合模拟评估决策。",
   "label": "【速记口诀】双钻模型四阶段",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-073",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 1,
   "text": "第三章 产品设计方法",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-074",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "【考情分析】本章每年分值16—20分，题型覆盖选择题、填空题、简答题、综合应用题。",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-075",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点一：研究与定义方法（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-076",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "用户访谈：半结构化最常用，技巧（追问、倾听、中立）；定性研究，挖掘“为什么”",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-077",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "观察法：参与式/非参与式，发现用户“所做”与“所说”的差异",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-078",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "问卷调查：定量验证，了解分布；设计要点（明确无歧义、选项完备互斥、长度适中）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-079",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "人物角色：基于研究数据创建的典型用户原型，包含目标、行为、痛点、动机",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-080",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "用户体验旅程图：可视化用户全流程体验，包含阶段、行为、触点、想法、情绪曲线、痛点与机会点",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-081",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "HMW问题：How Might We…，将洞察转化为设计挑战，应范围适中、以用户为中心、开放激发创意",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "6.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-082",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点二：概念形成与表达方法（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-083",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "头脑风暴：四大原则（追求数量、禁止批评、欢迎异想天开、结合与改进）；流程（准备→热身→发散→收敛）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-084",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "SCAMPER法：七种创意触发器（替代、合并、适应、修改、改他用、消除、反向/重组）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-085",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "故事板：用连环画描绘用户使用场景，可视化体验流程",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-086",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "设计草图：想法草图、概念草图、解说草图；重在快速表达概念",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-087",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "情绪板：拼贴图像、色彩、材质，定义设计“感觉”与调性",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-088",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点三：评估与细化方法（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-089",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "原型保真度：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-090",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "纸面、故事板，测试核心概念",
   "label": "低保真",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-091",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "可点击线框图、外观模型，测试交互细节",
   "label": "中保真",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-092",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "功能原型、高保真视觉，最终验证",
   "label": "高保真",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-093",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "用最低保真度回答当前最关键问题",
   "label": "原则",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-094",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "可用性测试：设定任务、观察记录、事后访谈；测试的是产品，不是用户",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-095",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "启发式评估：专家依据尼尔森十大原则检查界面，快速低成本",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-096",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "可行性—合意性—存续性框架：从技术、用户、商业三维度评估概念",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-097",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点四：设计实践法则（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-098",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "人机工程学：尺寸适配、易达原则、信息显示符合感知习惯、减少认知负荷",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-099",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "尼尔森十大可用性原则（必须熟记）：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-100",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "系统状态可见、系统与现实匹配、用户控制自由、一致性与标准化、防错",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-101",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "识别而非回忆、灵活高效、美学与简约、容错、帮助文档",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-102",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "菲茨定律：目标越大、距离越近，点击越快；应用于按钮尺寸与布局",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-103",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "格式塔原理：接近性、相似性、连续性、封闭性、主体/背景",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-104",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "产品语义学：形态应暗示功能、操作方式、传递情感与文化意义",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-105",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "访谈观察问卷；定义工具三剑客：人物角色旅程图HMW；创意发散头脑风暴SCAMPER；原型测试低保真中高保真，可用性测试定乾坤；设计法则十原则，人机菲茨格式塔。",
   "label": "【速记口诀】研究方法三件套",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-106",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 1,
   "text": "第四章 产品设计基础核心",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-107",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "【考情分析】本章每年分值24—28分，是分值最高的章节，题型覆盖选择题、填空题、简答题、手绘分析题。",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-108",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点一：产品造型语言（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-109",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "形态：几何形态（理性科技）、有机形态（亲和生命）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-110",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "比例与尺度：黄金分割（1:1.618）；尺度相对于人体或环境的感受",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-111",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "线条：直线（果断）、曲线（优雅）、腰线塑造产品性格",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-112",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "曲面：G2/G3连续产生流畅光影；过渡处理体现精致度",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-113",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "造型风格：现代主义、流线型、有机现代主义、后现代主义、高科技风格",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-114",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "情感化设计三层次（诺曼）：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "6.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-115",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "外观直接刺激（圆润友好、锐利专业）",
   "label": "本能层",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-116",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "使用乐趣与效率（暗示性、反馈）",
   "label": "行为层",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-117",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "个人意义、文化记忆（故事、身份）",
   "label": "反思层",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-118",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "品牌造型DNA：特征线、比例、细节处理代代延续（如宝马双肾格栅）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "7.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-119",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点二：产品表现技法（★★★★☆）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-120",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "设计草图：概念草图（快速记录）、细化草图（厘清结构）、展示草图（完整呈现）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-121",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "透视基础：一点透视（庄严）、两点透视（自然）、三点透视（夸张）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-122",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "数字二维渲染：PS常用加深/减淡工具塑造光影；材质贴图模拟真实",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-123",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "三维建模：NURBS建模（Rhino/Alias，曲面精准）、实体建模（SolidWorks/Creo，参数化）、多边形建模（3ds Max/C4D，灵活）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-124",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "渲染：Keyshot常用，灯光（三点布光、HDRI）、材质节点调节、后期处理",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-125",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "原型制作：CNC加工（精度高）、3D打印（快速复杂）、真空复模（小批量）、手工打磨涂装",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "6.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-126",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点三：CMF设计（★★★★☆）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-127",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "色彩：潘通色卡、色彩心理学（红激情、蓝科技、绿环保、黑高端）；色彩策略（品牌色、产品线区分、市场定位、功能暗示）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-128",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "材料：ABS（易喷涂）、PC（透明）、金属（阳极氧化、PVD）、玻璃、木材/皮革（温暖）、生物基材料（环保）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-129",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "表面处理：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-130",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "普通、UV、橡胶漆、金属质感漆",
   "label": "喷涂",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-131",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "丝印、移印、水转印、IMD/IML",
   "label": "印刷",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-132",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "水电镀、真空镀(PVD)、阳极氧化(铝)",
   "label": "电镀与阳极氧化",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-133",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "增加触感、隐藏划痕",
   "label": "咬花/蚀纹",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-134",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "永久标记、装饰纹理",
   "label": "激光雕刻",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-135",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "CMF设计流程：趋势研究→设计定位→情绪板→方案创作→打样验证→技术实现",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-136",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点四：产品结构设计基础（★★★★☆）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-137",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "壁厚均匀原则：避免缩痕、翘曲；常用壁厚范围1.0—3.0mm",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-138",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "脱模斜度：外观面1°—2°，内部面0.5°—1°，纹理面需额外增加",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-139",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "加强筋：高度≤壁厚3倍，根部厚度为壁厚40%—60%，根部加圆角",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-140",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "孔与凸台：通孔优于盲孔，凸台外径为螺钉直径2—2.5倍，需加强筋连接",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-141",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "卡扣设计：悬臂梁卡扣最常见，需计算挠曲量，保证导入角和回止角",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "5.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-142",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "装配设计（DFA）：减少零件数量、模块化、标准化、易于抓取定位、防错",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "6.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-143",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "模具常识：分型线、浇口、顶针、滑块/斜顶；设计应避免倒扣，进行拔模分析",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "7.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-144",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "输出文件：3D数据（STEP/IGES）、二维工程图（标注公差）、外观标注图（CMF要求）、BOM、设计说明",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "8.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-145",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "【速记口诀】造型语言形态线面比例尺度，情感三层本能行为反思；表现技法草图建模渲染原型，CMF色彩材料工艺三位一体；结构设计壁厚均匀拔模斜度，加强筋卡扣装配DFA模具常识。",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-146",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 1,
   "text": "第五章 产品服务系统",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-147",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "【考情分析】本章每年分值20—24分，题型覆盖选择题、填空题、简答题、案例分析题。",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-148",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点一：服务设计（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-149",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "服务与产品的区别：无形、不可存储、生产消费同时、易变、价值产生于互动",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-150",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "服务设计五大原则：以用户为中心、共创、序列性、实体化证据、整体性",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-151",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "核心工具：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-152",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "识别所有相关方及其关系",
   "label": "利益相关者地图",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-153",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "从用户视角可视化全流程体验（阶段、行为、触点、情绪、痛点、机会）",
   "label": "用户旅程图",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-154",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "从组织视角揭示前台后台支持系统（互动线、可见线、内部互动线）",
   "label": "服务蓝图",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-155",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "故事板、角色扮演、Wizard of Oz测试",
   "label": "服务原型",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-156",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "案例：星巴克“啡快”——移动点单+专属取餐区，时空解耦，提升效率与体验",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "4.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-157",
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "核心考点二：可持续设计（★★★★★）",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-158",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "理念演进：末端治理→绿色设计(3R)→生态设计(仿效自然)→可持续设计(系统变革)",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "1.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-159",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "三重底线：经济、环境、社会",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-160",
   "type": "list_item",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "设计策略：",
   "label": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "ordered": true,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-161",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "材料选择（可再生/回收）、轻量化、能效优化、延长寿命",
   "label": "低层级",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-162",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "产品服务系统（PSS）、模块化、为拆解而设计",
   "label": "中层级",
   "marker": "",
   "ordered": false,
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [],
   "depth": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "blk-163",
   "type": "kv",
   "level": 0,
   "text": "循环经济（技术循环、生物循环）、再生设计、本地化分布式生产",
   "label": "高层级",
   "marker": "",
